        "text": "Hey ${{name}}, hold up!\n I've been thinking a lot about what you did for my tuxemon, and I have to admit, it got me thinking about my own priorities.\n I realized I've been too focused on my own goals, and I haven't been doing enough to help others.\n That's why I'm coming with you to take down those tuxemon thieves.\n We owe it to ourselves, our tuxemon, and the entire community to put a stop to their nefarious plans.",
        "tick": 0
