        "seq": 3,
        "stateStack": [
          "SinkState",
          "WorldState",
          "BackgroundState"
        ],
        "text": "I've been watching you from the shop, and I have to say, I'm impressed.\n You've come a long way since you first got your tuxemon.\n I've been feeling a bit guilty, I'm the one who helped you get that tuxemon, and I feel like I've got a responsibility to help you see this through.\n Plus, I've got to admit, I'm a bit curious to see how this all plays out. So, I'm coming with you to take down those tuxemon thieves.\n Let's do this!",
