    "visibleDialogs": [
      {
        "count": 1,
        "key": "spyder_omnichannel_billie1",
        "text": "Hey ${{name}}, hold up!\n I've been thinking a lot about what you did for my tuxemon, and I have to admit, it got me thinking about my own priorities.\n I realized I've been too focused on my own goals, and I haven't been doing enough to help others.\n That's why I'm coming with you to take down those tuxemon thieves.\n We owe it to ourselves, our tuxemon, and the entire community to put a stop to their nefarious plans."
      },
      {
        "count": 1,
        "key": "spyder_omnichannel_dante1",
        "text": "I've been watching you from the shop, and I have to say, I'm impressed.\n You've come a long way since you first got your tuxemon.\n I've been feeling a bit guilty, I'm the one who helped you get that tuxemon, and I feel like I've got a responsibility to help you see this through.\n Plus, I've got to admit, I'm a bit curious to see how this all plays out. So, I'm coming with you to take down those tuxemon thieves.\n Let's do this!"
      },
      {
        "count": 1,
        "key": "spyder_omnichannel_beaverbrook1",
        "text": "Aha, it's too late for you! \n Just out of the birthing pit ... the perfect monsters! \n The genes of Drokoro incubated in dragon eggs dug up by Shaft \n ... and fused with three killer robos designed by Nimrod. \n The power of teamwork ... and it's in my hands. "
      },
      {
        "count": 1,
        "key": "spyder_omnichannel_dante2",
        "text": "That was a close one! I'm just glad we were able to take down those thieves.\n You've got a bright future ahead of you, ${{name}}. Don't forget about me when you're a famous tuxemon master, okay?"
      },
      {
        "count": 1,
        "key": "spyder_omnichannel_billie2",
        "text": "I'm proud of you, ${{name}}. You've come a long way since we first met.\n I think it's time for me to head back to Paper Town, but I'll never forget this adventure we shared."
      },
      {
        "count": 1,
        "key": "spyder_omnichannel_beaverbrook2",
        "text": "No. It's not possible. \n Two upstarts, one with off-brand tuxemon, defeating my perfect creations. \n If I can just make it to my live radio interview, I'll command my enforcers to complete the takeover."
      },
      {
        "count": 2,
        "key": "heal_before_leave",
        "text": "You should heal your monsters before heading off."
      }
    ]
